{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport urllib.request, pathlib\np=pathlib.Path('vendor')\nfor name in ['README.md','session.js','bridge.js','round.js','harness.html']:\n    data=urllib.request.urlopen('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/'+name).read()\n    (p/('hub-'+name if name=='README.md' else name)).write_bytes(data)\nprint('AI Hub protocol files saved.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
